  <!-- EN: minigun complex -->
  <VFES_Complex_Minigun.label>固定式速射机枪</VFES_Complex_Minigun.label>
  <!-- EN: A multi-barrel machine gun mounted on sandbags to grant cover and provide stability. Where most self-loading guns are powered by the energy from the gunpowder, the minigun uses an electric motor to rapidly cycle cartridges through the weapon. Needs to be manned in order to fire. Requires steel to refurbish its barrels after heavy use. -->
  <VFES_Complex_Minigun.description>一种固定在沙袋上的速射机枪。大多数自动武器都使用火药燃气来为自动机构提供动力，而它使用电动马达来快速装填子弹。必须有人手动操纵。沙袋能为射击者提供良好的掩护效果。长期使用后需要大量的钢铁维护枪管。</VFES_Complex_Minigun.description>
  <!-- EN: Barrel durability -->
  <VFES_Complex_Minigun.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>枪管耐久度</VFES_Complex_Minigun.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Shots until barrel change -->
