  <!-- EN: armored turret -->
  <VFES_Turret_ArmoredTurret.label>装甲自动机枪塔</VFES_Turret_ArmoredTurret.label>
  <!-- EN: An armored, portable automatic turret. Requires steel to refurbish its barrel after heavy use. Extra armor plating allows the turret to provide some cover, makes it more resistant to enemy fire and prevents explosion in case of severe damage. Its dumb AI brain can't be directly controlled, so beware of friendly fire. -->
  <VFES_Turret_ArmoredTurret.description>一种小型、短程的便携式自动机枪塔。长期使用后需要大量的钢铁维护炮管。额外安装的加固装甲赋予了这种炮塔更好的防护能力，也能防止它在受损严重时爆炸。由于是人工智能来运行无法被直接控制，所以要小心友军误伤。</VFES_Turret_ArmoredTurret.description>
  <!-- EN: Barrel durability -->
  <VFES_Turret_ArmoredTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>枪管耐久度</VFES_Turret_ArmoredTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Shots until barrel change -->
  <VFES_Turret_ArmoredTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>更换枪管前剩余射击次数</VFES_Turret_ArmoredTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Needs new barrel -->
  <VFES_Turret_ArmoredTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>需要新的枪管</VFES_Turret_ArmoredTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: double autocannon turret -->
  <VFES_Turret_AutocannonDouble.label>双管自动加农炮塔</VFES_Turret_AutocannonDouble.label>
  <!-- EN: A twin-barreled variant of the autocannon turret. While less accurate and slightly shorter-ranged than its single-barreled cousin, it compensates with a high volume of fire. It cannot fire at close-up targets, and may explode when damaged. -->
  <VFES_Turret_AutocannonDouble.description>一种重型双管自动炮塔。与单管的自动加农炮塔相比，它不仅精度更低，射程也更近，但换来了更高的射速。它的炮管在使用后必须进行翻新。它不能向近距离的目标开火。受损严重时可能会爆炸。</VFES_Turret_AutocannonDouble.description>
  <!-- EN: Barrel durability -->
  <VFES_Turret_AutocannonDouble.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>炮管耐久度</VFES_Turret_AutocannonDouble.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Shots until barrel change -->
  <VFES_Turret_AutocannonDouble.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>更换炮管前剩余射击次数</VFES_Turret_AutocannonDouble.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Needs new barrel -->
  <VFES_Turret_AutocannonDouble.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>需要新的炮管</VFES_Turret_AutocannonDouble.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: ballista -->
  <VFES_Turret_Ballista.label>弩炮</VFES_Turret_Ballista.label>
  <!-- EN: An ancient military siege engine in the form of a crossbow mounted on a wooden construct. Bolts fired from this machine explode into splinters on impact. Needs to be manned in order to fire. -->
  <VFES_Turret_Ballista.description>一种安装在木制结构上的弩型古老军事攻城器械，它射出的弩箭命中目标后会破裂成大量锋利的碎片。必须有人手动操纵。</VFES_Turret_Ballista.description>
  <!-- EN: Ballista bolts -->
  <VFES_Turret_Ballista.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>弩箭</VFES_Turret_Ballista.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Ballista bolts -->
  <VFES_Turret_Ballista.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>剩余弩箭</VFES_Turret_Ballista.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Needs ballista bolts -->
  <VFES_Turret_Ballista.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>需要弩箭</VFES_Turret_Ballista.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: catapult -->
  <VFES_Turret_Catapult.label>投石机</VFES_Turret_Catapult.label>
  <!-- EN: A ballistic device used to launch a projectile a great distance without the aid of gunpowder or other propellants. In use since ancient times, the catapult has proven to be one of the most persistently effective mechanisms in warfare. -->
  <VFES_Turret_Catapult.description>一种无须借助火药就能将石块抛至远处的弹射装置。必须有人手动操纵。作为一种战争利器，投石机的使用历史漫长而广泛。</VFES_Turret_Catapult.description>
  
  <!-- EN: charge railgun -->
  <VFES_Turret_ChargeRailgun.label>电荷轨道炮塔</VFES_Turret_ChargeRailgun.label>
  <!-- EN: A cutting-edge, pulse-charged, rail-assisted weapon system that fires a short burst of high-velocity projectiles, energized with unstable plasma as they leave the rail. The resulting shots pierce armor and bodies alike, but the turret requires new plasteel barrel after use. It cannot fire at close range, and may explode when damaged. -->
  <VFES_Turret_ChargeRailgun.description>一种能发射一连串高速子弹的尖端电荷轨道武器系统。电荷弹技术使得每发子弹在离开加速轨道时都会由不稳定能量进行充能，可以轻而易举地击穿装甲和血肉。长期使用后需要大量的玻璃钢维护炮管。它不能向近距离的目标开火。受损严重时可能会爆炸。</VFES_Turret_ChargeRailgun.description>
  <!-- EN: Barrel durability -->
  <VFES_Turret_ChargeRailgun.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>枪管耐久度</VFES_Turret_ChargeRailgun.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Shots until barrel change -->
  <VFES_Turret_ChargeRailgun.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>更换枪管前剩余射击次数</VFES_Turret_ChargeRailgun.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Needs new barrel -->
  <VFES_Turret_ChargeRailgun.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>需要新枪管</VFES_Turret_ChargeRailgun.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: charge turret -->
  <VFES_Turret_ChargeTurret.label>电荷炮塔</VFES_Turret_ChargeTurret.label>
  <!-- EN: A portable automatic charged-shot turret. Pulse-charge technology charges each shot with unstable energy as it leaves the barrel. Requires plasteel to refurbish its barrel after heavy use. May explode when damaged. Its dumb AI brain can't be directly controlled, so beware of friendly fire. -->
  <VFES_Turret_ChargeTurret.description>一种小型、短程的便携式自动电荷炮塔。电荷弹技术使得每发子弹在离开枪管时都会由不稳定能量进行充能，并且在击中物体的时候完全释放出来，大大增加了子弹的伤害。长期使用后需要大量的玻璃钢维护炮管。受损严重时可能会爆炸。由于是人工智能来运行无法被直接控制，所以要小心友军误伤。</VFES_Turret_ChargeTurret.description>
  <!-- EN: Barrel durability -->
  <VFES_Turret_ChargeTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>枪管耐久度</VFES_Turret_ChargeTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Shots until barrel change -->
  <VFES_Turret_ChargeTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>更换枪管前剩余射击次数</VFES_Turret_ChargeTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Needs new barrel -->
  <VFES_Turret_ChargeTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>需要新枪管</VFES_Turret_ChargeTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: flamer turret -->
  <VFES_Turret_Flame.label>火舌炮塔</VFES_Turret_Flame.label>
  <!-- EN: A portable flamethrower turret, capable of spewing a cone of flame that engulfs enemies and terrain. May explode when damaged. Its dumb AI brain can't be directly controlled, so beware of friendly fire. -->
  <VFES_Turret_Flame.description>一种小型、短程的便携式喷火炮塔。它可以喷射出一股火舌，点燃一定范围内的敌人和地面。受损严重时可能会爆炸。由于是人工智能来运行无法被直接控制，所以要小心友军误伤。</VFES_Turret_Flame.description>
  <!-- EN: Remaining fuel -->
  <VFES_Turret_Flame.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>燃料</VFES_Turret_Flame.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Remaining fuel -->
  <VFES_Turret_Flame.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>剩余燃料</VFES_Turret_Flame.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Needs chemfuel -->
  <VFES_Turret_Flame.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>需要燃料</VFES_Turret_Flame.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: military turret -->
  <VFES_Turret_MilitaryTurret.label>军用自动机枪塔</VFES_Turret_MilitaryTurret.label>
  <!-- EN: A refined turret with military-grade stabilization, targeting routines, and hardened casing. Requires steel to refurbish its barrel after heavy use. May explode when damaged. Its dumb AI brain can't be directly controlled, so beware of friendly fire. -->
  <VFES_Turret_MilitaryTurret.description>一种应用了军规火控和改进结构的便携式自动机枪塔。长期使用后需要大量的钢铁维护枪管。受损严重时可能会爆炸。由于是人工智能来运行无法被直接控制，所以要小心友军误伤。</VFES_Turret_MilitaryTurret.description>
  <!-- EN: Barrel durability -->
  <VFES_Turret_MilitaryTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>枪管耐久度</VFES_Turret_MilitaryTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Shots until barrel change -->
  <VFES_Turret_MilitaryTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>更换枪管前剩余射击次数</VFES_Turret_MilitaryTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Needs new barrel -->
  <VFES_Turret_MilitaryTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>需要新枪管</VFES_Turret_MilitaryTurret.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: minigun turret -->
  <VFES_Turret_Minigun.label>速射机枪塔</VFES_Turret_Minigun.label>
  <!-- EN: A heavy automatic turret. Its multi-barrel mechanism unleashes sustained fire at high speed, shredding lightly armored targets at mid-range. It may explode when damaged. Requires steel to refurbish its barrels after heavy use. -->
  <VFES_Turret_Minigun.description>一种重型自动机枪塔。多管结构的速射机枪可以持续高速射击，撕裂中距离的轻装甲目标。受损严重时可能会爆炸。长期使用后需要大量的钢铁维护枪管。</VFES_Turret_Minigun.description>
  <!-- EN: Barrel durability -->
